§§ `Order 39 Rule 3 -- evidence in support of the application`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Rule 3: "An application for registration must be supported by an affidavit" that does the things in (a), (b) and (c).
DECLARE `o 39 r 3 what the affidavit does` HAS
    `o 39 r 3(a) it exhibits the Commitment, Direction or Decision, or a verified or certified or otherwise duly authenticated copy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 39 r 3(b)(i) it states the name, trade or business and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the party seeking to register` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 39 r 3(b)(ii) it states the same of the other party, so far as known to the deponent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 39 r 3(c)(i) it states to the best of the information or belief of the deponent that the applying party is entitled to enforce the instrument` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 39 r 3(c)(ii) it states to the best of the information or belief of the deponent that as at the date of the application the instrument has not been complied with` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 39 r 3(c)(iii) it states to the best of the information or belief of the deponent the amount of financial penalty which remains unsatisfied` IS A BOOLEAN

-- (c)(iii) is required only "if applicable": the duty arises where a financial penalty was imposed and part remains unsatisfied.
-- src:5537 | (iii)
-- src:5538 | the amount of financial penalty imposed under the Commitment, Direction or Decision which remains unsatisfied, if applicable.
@ref O 39 r 3(c)(iii) (src:5537-5538)
GIVEN `a financial penalty was imposed under the instrument and part of it remains unsatisfied` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 39 r 3(c)(iii) a statement of the unsatisfied financial penalty is required` MEANS
    IF `a financial penalty was imposed under the instrument and part of it remains unsatisfied`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if applicable"

-- FORK QB | bare "must be supported by an affidavit ... stating": the affidavit lacks a required statement | NOTHING | JUST FALSE for the compliance question
-- FORK QD | paragraph (c)(iii) when no penalty is unsatisfied: not required (companion above answers JUST FALSE); the whole-affidavit function counts it as met | its own compliance function answering NOTHING
