@ref O 39 r 3 (src:5524-5538)
GIVEN `an affidavit supports the application` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a financial penalty was imposed under the instrument and part of it remains unsatisfied` IS A BOOLEAN
      affidavit IS A `o 39 r 3 what the affidavit does`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 39 r 3 the application is supported by an affidavit as the Rule requires` MEANS
    IF     `an affidavit supports the application`
       AND affidavit's `o 39 r 3(a) it exhibits the Commitment, Direction or Decision, or a verified or certified or otherwise duly authenticated copy`
       AND affidavit's `o 39 r 3(b)(i) it states the name, trade or business and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the party seeking to register`
